# Example production configuration for the mobile platform.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.production`. `pnpm build` runs Vite in production
# mode, which reads it over `.env`; `npx cap sync` then copies that build into
# the iOS and Android projects, so the installed app talks to this API.
# Never commit the real file.
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed VITE_ to import.meta.env, and bakes
# them into the bundle: never put a secret here.

# --- REST API ------------------------------------------------------------
# The deployed web service, including the /api/v1 prefix, e.g. the Render URL:
# https://<your-service>.onrender.com/api/v1
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
